  m_Name: TheStarsCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  Name: The Stars
  text: "The card glimmers in your hand, a single star shining in the darkness. 
    $Its light is soft, yet unwavering, guiding the lost and whispering truths unspoken. 
    $You feel it pulse with the Princess\u2019s heart\u2014bound by duty, yet yearning
    for freedom.  $Her secret is no longer hidden from you: her love belongs to the
    Head of the Royal Guard, and her soul longs for the path she cannot yet take. 
    $The Star reminds you that even in the shadows of obligation, hope and desire
    can shine bright."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40a584c545ee2d236a3c7985c38a47ff, type: 3}
